SUMMARY:Deadline: Sheer Spite Press: Digital Distro Call for Zine Submissio
 ns
DESCRIPTION:Sheer Spite Press\, a Montreal-based independent press running 
 since 2024\, is open for submissions of zines to be distributed digitally 
 as PDFs through its new digital distro (no print at this time). PRIORITIZI
 NG work that is long\, text-centric\, passionate\, personal\, anti-authori
 tarian and accessible (probably not poetry)\, on topics like community car
 e\, friendship\, history\, food\, sex and kink\, memoir\, DIY and adventur
 es. TERMS: the press sells your PDFs\, you choose your own pricing and kee
 p up to 80 percent of sales\, paid quarterly (very modest sums expected)\;
  distribution is non-exclusive\, so you can keep selling your zines anywhe
 re else. Note this is a revenue-share distribution arrangement\, not a gra
 nt or stipend. Submit via the CryptPad form linked from the call\; questio
 ns to lee@sheerspite.ca. No submission fee. Open until 31 December 2026.\n
 \nOrganisation: Sheer Spite Press\nLocation: Montreal\, Canada (digital di
 stribution\, open worldwide)\nAward: Revenue share\, not a grant: creators
  set their own PDF pricing and keep up to 80 percent of each sale\, paid q
 uarterly (modest sums expected)\; non-exclusive\, you can keep selling els
 ewhere\nDuration: Ongoing digital distribution via the Sheer Spite distro\
 n\nMore: https://sheerspite.ca/blog/2026/09/02/call-for-submissions-digita
 l-zines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://sheerspite.ca/blog/2026/09/02/call-for-submissions-digital-zine
 s/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Montreal\, Canada (digital distribution\, open worldwide)
END:VEVENT
